{title: Bulleya}
{artist: Amit Mishra Pritam Ae Dil Hai Mushkil Adhm}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Meri rooh ka parinda phad [A#]phadaaye,        Lekin [Dm]sukoon ka jazira mil na [A#]paye
Ve ki [D#]karan ve ki [A]karan,        Ik [Dm]baar ko tajalli toh [A#]dikha de
Jhuti [Dm]sahi magar tasalli to [A#]dila de,        Ve ki [D#]karan ve ki [A]karan
Ranjhan de [Dm]yaar bulleya,        Sun le pu [A#]kaar bulleya
Tu hi toh [C]yaar bulleya,        Murshid [A#]mera (murshid [Dm]mera)
Tera [Dm]mukaam kamle,        Sarhad ke [A#]paar bulleya
Parvardi [C]gar bulleya,        Hafiz [A#]tera (murshid [Dm]mera)
Ranjhan de [Dm]yaar bulleya,        Sun le pu [A#]kaar bulleya
Tu hi toh [C]yaar bulleya,        Murshid [A#]mera (murshid [Dm]mera)
Main [Dm]kabul se mitti titli ki,        [C]tarah muhajir hoon
Ek [A#]pal ko thehrun, pal me udd [A]jaun,        Ve main ta [Dm]hoon pagdandi Labhdi
ae jo [C]raah jannat di,        Tu [A#]mude jahaan main saath mud [A]jaun
Tere [Dm]kaarwa me shaamil hona [A#]chahun
Kamiya [Dm]tarash ke mai kabil hona [A#]chahu,        Ve ki [D#]karan ve ki [A]karan
Ranjhan de [Dm]yaar bulleya,        Sun le pu [A#]kaar bulleya
Tu hi toh [C]yaar bulleya,        Murshid [A#]mera (murshid [Dm]mera)
[Dm]Jis din se ashna se do [C]ajnabi huve hai
[C]Tanhaiyo ke lamhe sab mult [A#]avi huve hai,        [A#]Kyun aaj main mohabbat
[A#]Phir ek baar karna [A]chahun,        Haan?
Ye [Dm]dil to dhundta hai [C]inkar ke bahane
[C]Lekin ye jism koi paban [A#]diyan na maane,        [A#]Milke tujhe, bagaawat
[A#]khud se hi yaar karna [A]chahun,        Mujhme [Dm]agan hai baaki [A#]aazma le
Le [Dm]kar rahi hun khud ko mai tere [A#]hawale,        Ve [D#]Raanjhna? Ve [A]Raanjhna?
